2026-03-06 15:54:54 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator: 功能说明:
2026-03-06 15:54:54 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 这是一个虚拟实现，用于开发和测试环境
2026-03-06 15:54:54 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 会订阅 PERSON_WARNING 事件并记录详细日志
