2026-03-06 15:54:54 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator: 真实环境行为说明:
2026-03-06 15:54:54 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 真实环境下会使用 CANCommunicator 连接实际的 CAN 总线
