2026-03-06 15:54:54 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 使用通道 can0，波特率 250000
2026-03-06 15:54:54 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 会发送实际的 CAN 消息到硬件设备
